From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 03:57:33 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] setupapi: file logs, SetupInstallFile subdirectories, one
 queued copy per file, empty OEM inf name

SetupInitializeFileLog, SetupLogFile, SetupQueryFileLog, SetupRemoveFileLogEntry and
SetupTerminateFileLog keep a log of installed files (an INI file with the source,
checksum, tag file, description and other info per target). SetupInstallFile with an
INF line looks the source up in SourceDisksFiles and uses its subdirectory. The same
copy queued twice is run once. SetupUninstallOEMInf of an empty name fails with
ERROR_FILE_NOT_FOUND. Removes 4 todo_wine in setupapi's install and misc tests.

